  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.15.0 adds opaque Unicode-placeholder virtual raster placements, self-contained semantic placeholder-cell output, and physical placement relative to a virtual parent while preserving caller-owned screen layout and private protocol identity. It also advances the production Icod.TermInfo dependency to 1.14.0 and qualifies the optional TermInfo 1.14 advisory raster-backend planning boundary without changing Terminal's production router. Release notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/main/docs/releases/1.15.0.md. Compatibility policy: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/main/docs/Compatibility-and-Versioning.md.",
